{% comment %}
  Maison Cavallé — action arrow
  Prototype source: maison-cavalle-main/app.js → ACTION_ARROW_SVG,
                    replaceActionArrowGlyphs
                    maison-cavalle-main/styles.css → .action-arrow (121–122)

  The prototype swapped its "↗" text glyph for this icon and walks the DOM at
  runtime replacing every occurrence. Liquid can render it in place instead, so
  there is no glyph to replace and no flash of the wrong character.

  Every direction is the same path turned about its centre, so a row of arrows
  reads as one set — a second hand-drawn path never quite matches the weight of
  this one. The turn is applied inside the SVG, leaving the CSS transform free
  for the hover nudge.

  Accepts:
    direction - up-right (default), right, down-right, down, down-left, left,
                up-left, up
    class     - extra class for a context that sizes the arrow itself
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  case direction
    when 'right'
      assign turn = 45
    when 'down-right'
      assign turn = 90
    when 'down'
      assign turn = 135
    when 'down-left'
      assign turn = 180
    when 'left'
      assign turn = 225
    when 'up-left'
      assign turn = 270
    when 'up'
      assign turn = 315
    else
      assign turn = 0
  endcase
%}
{%- comment -%}
  The path is a diagonal that fills the square. Turned to right, left, up or
  down its point reaches past the viewBox and the tip was clipped, so the SVG
  lets it overflow — the arrow keeps the diagonal's size and weight.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg
  class="jci-action-arrow{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  viewBox="0 0 512 512"
  overflow="visible"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
  <g{% if turn != 0 %} transform="rotate({{ turn }} 256 256)"{% endif %}>
    <path
      d="M512 21.805v331.202c0 12.042-9.763 21.805-21.805 21.805s-21.805-9.763-21.805-21.805V74.451L37.225 505.615c-4.259 4.257-9.838 6.386-15.419 6.386s-11.16-2.129-15.419-6.386c-8.516-8.516-8.516-22.323 0-30.839L437.553 43.61h-278.56c-12.042 0-21.805-9.763-21.805-21.805S146.951 0 158.993 0h331.202C502.237-.001 512 9.763 512 21.805"
      fill="currentColor"
    ></path>
  </g>
</svg>
